 "diag_autotiles": {
  "rule": "45-degree corner autotiles (shared by Saltmere v2 and Highfen v3.1).\nMask = which tile CORNERS are inside the terrain: NW=1, NE=2, SE=4, SW=8 (16 frames, frame index = mask).\nA set corner owns the 45deg diamond around it (|dx|+|dy|<=8 px); two set corners on one side own that half tile.\n=> 1 corner = outer 45deg diagonal cut, 3 corners = inner 45deg diagonal, 2 adjacent = straight edge, 2 opposite = saddle.\nA 45deg run alternates diag_out_* / diag_in_* tiles; a straight edge meeting a diag is the straight->diagonal transition.\nSample the shape on the (GH+1)x(GW+1) vertex grid; tile (y,x) frame = V[y,x]*1+V[y,x+1]*2+V[y+1,x+1]*4+V[y+1,x]*8.",
